        Say "Harharhar...so I finally have it! What? You want to know what this is? There's no need for you to know that. Just take this receipt and go."
        Topic "Confirm" do
            Transaction
                Take 1 of 900213000
                Give 1 of 900193000
    Else if quest 648 is started
